# Public sign-in settings for `npm run dev` (http://localhost:5173/virtual-table-top-ember-reach/) (VTTER-53, docs/adr/0004-auth-cognito.md).
# Not secrets: the Cognito app client is public and uses PKCE. Leave VITE_AUTH_CLIENT_ID empty to hide sign-in.
# Fill these in from the EmberreachAuth and EmberreachApi stack outputs after the first deploy.
VITE_AUTH_DOMAIN=emberreach-login.auth.us-east-2.amazoncognito.com
VITE_AUTH_CLIENT_ID=1hj9958u292ut2enjppfiri2vj
VITE_API_URL=https://7ybva8z4v3.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com
